{
 "title": "数组和类型别名",
 "blocks": [
  {
   "t": "p",
   "text": "**数组**保存固定数量的同类型值：类型是 `[N]T`，即 `N` 个 `T`。长度在编译期已知。用 `array[i]` 访问元素（从 0 开始计数），用 `.len` 获取长度。`[0; 100]` 构造一个由一百个 0 组成的数组。"
  },
  {
   "t": "code",
   "code": [
    "fn main():",
    "    numbers: [4]i32 = [10, 20, 30, 40]",
    "    print(\"first:\", numbers[0])",
    "    print(\"length:\", numbers.len)",
    "    numbers[1] = 99",
    "    print(numbers[1])",
    "    zeros: [100]i32 = [0; 100]",
    "    print(zeros.len)"
   ],
   "run": true,
   "output": [
    "first: 10",
    "length: 4",
    "99",
    "100"
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "text": "索引越界会在运行时停止程序；它绝不会悄悄写到内存的错误位置。用 **`type`** 可以给很长的类型起个短名字。"
  },
  {
   "t": "code",
   "code": [
    "type Point = (f64, f64)",
    "",
    "fn dist2(a: Point, b: Point) -> f64:",
    "    dx = a.0 - b.0",
    "    dy = a.1 - b.1",
    "    return dx * dx + dy * dy",
    "",
    "fn main():",
    "    origin: Point = (0.0, 0.0)",
    "    target: Point = (3.0, 4.0)",
    "    print(dist2(origin, target))"
   ],
   "run": true,
   "output": [
    "25"
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "exercise",
   "id": "c04-l04-x1",
   "prompt": "找出数组中最大的数字并输出。",
   "starter": [
    "fn main():",
    "    data: [5]i32 = [8, 3, 15, 4, 9]",
    "    best = data[0]",
    "    print(best)"
   ],
   "solution": [
    "fn main():",
    "    data: [5]i32 = [8, 3, 15, 4, 9]",
    "    best = data[0]",
    "    for x in data:",
    "        if x > best:",
    "            best = x",
    "    print(best)"
   ],
   "hint": "用 `for x in data:` 遍历；当 `x > best` 时执行 `best = x`。",
   "expected": [
    "15"
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "quiz",
   "id": "c04-l04-q1",
   "q": "`[3]i32` 数组的有效索引有哪些？",
   "options": [
    "1, 2, 3",
    "0, 1, 2",
    "0, 1, 2, 3"
   ],
   "answer": 1,
   "why": "三个元素的索引是 0、1、2。"
  }
 ]
}
